    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US !</h1><p><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/10e03ee5985c3d35f0a7e17d6bff8ad8.avif?t=1747846261\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/70474f3c6b38d04823bc9a896823e515.avif?t=1747846261\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE A VIRTUAL WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.poster.avif?t=1747846261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.webm?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.mp4?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Battle your way through unique and beautiful locations. Packed with challenge monsters and enormous bosses bent on taking you out, don\u2019t give them the satisfaction!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/924d5d1f1afe55411bcf4d555700a9b9.poster.avif?t=1747846261\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/924d5d1f1afe55411bcf4d555700a9b9.webp?t=1747846261\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick one of six characters each with unique abilities and battle styles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/cfe6f8fc5369b42aff93709cc14b22e5.avif?t=1747846261\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself by taking on enemies alone, or with up to four of your friends online and battle cooperatively!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.poster.avif?t=1747846261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.webm?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.mp4?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.poster.avif?t=1747846261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.webm?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.mp4?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE A VIRTUAL WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.poster.avif?t=1747846261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.webm?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/c075679faa04c411865856fe589fc47b.mp4?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Battle your way through unique and beautiful locations. Packed with challenge monsters and enormous bosses bent on taking you out, don\u2019t give them the satisfaction!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/924d5d1f1afe55411bcf4d555700a9b9.poster.avif?t=1747846261\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/924d5d1f1afe55411bcf4d555700a9b9.webp?t=1747846261\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick one of six characters each with unique abilities and battle styles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/cfe6f8fc5369b42aff93709cc14b22e5.avif?t=1747846261\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself by taking on enemies alone, or with up to four of your friends online and battle cooperatively!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.poster.avif?t=1747846261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.webm?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/25a6b63b7691fd7a276d02c1251a5e4a.mp4?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.poster.avif?t=1747846261\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.webm?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425000/extras/bb93532c47788492856d1f69306d0c8b.mp4?t=1747846261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Endless Alice is a third-person action-adventure game combining Roguelite elements, anime aesthetics, and endless possibilities. Choose characters with unique combat styles and embark on adventures! Play solo or with friends in cooperative challenges for up to 4 players!",
